  "worked_solution": "First, we compute the triple scalar product \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a\\cdot (b\\times c) & =\u27e86,1,-9\u27e9\\cdot \u27e82,5,1\u27e9 \\\\  & =6\\cdot 2+1\\cdot 5+(-9)\\cdot 1 \\\\  & =12+5-9 \\\\  & =8.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we swap $a$ and $b$ to get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}b\\cdot (a\\times c)=-8.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
